---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Faculty & Staff
description: The faculty and staff of Westside Baptist Academy are ministry-minded individuals who know each student by name.
permalink: /about/faculty/
noindex: true
---

{# noindex: true keeps this page out of Google and off the sitemap. It is
   still a public page — anyone with the link, or following the link in the
   footer, can read it. What it stops is staff names surfacing in a search for
   their own name. If the page needs to be genuinely private, that is a
   different job and needs a login. #}

<div class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="section__eyebrow">About</span>
    <h1>Faculty &amp; Staff</h1>
    <p class="page-head__lede">The faculty and staff of Westside Baptist Academy are ministry-minded individuals. Most will teach your child for more than one year — and will know them long after.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="section">
  <div class="wrap">

    {# Support Staff and Fine Arts are small — two people and one — so they
       share a row directly under Administration rather than each taking a
       full-width band of their own. The teaching sections follow. #}
    {% macro group_block(group, extra, alphabetical) %}
      {% set members = faculty.people | where("group", group) %}
      {% if alphabetical %}{% set members = members | bySurname %}{% endif %}
      {% if members.length %}
      <div class="faculty-group {{ extra }}">
        <h2>{{ group }}</h2>
        <div class="grid grid--4">
          {% for person in members %}
          {# An entry with no role is unfinished. It shows on the preview build
             so the gap is visible to the office, and is left off the live site
             rather than publishing a name with a blank line under it. #}
          {% if person.role or env.preview %}
          <div class="person{% if not person.role %} person--incomplete{% endif %}">
            {% if person.photo %}
            <picture>
              <source type="image/webp"
                      srcset="/assets/img/faculty/{{ person.photo }}-300.webp 300w,
                              /assets/img/faculty/{{ person.photo }}-600.webp 600w"
                      sizes="(min-width: 62rem) 15rem, (min-width: 40rem) 22vw, 45vw">
              <img class="person__photo person__photo--img"
                   src="/assets/img/faculty/{{ person.photo }}-300.jpg"
                   srcset="/assets/img/faculty/{{ person.photo }}-300.jpg 300w,
                           /assets/img/faculty/{{ person.photo }}-600.jpg 600w"
                   sizes="(min-width: 62rem) 15rem, (min-width: 40rem) 22vw, 45vw"
                   width="600" height="600"
                   alt="{{ person.name }}"
                   loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            </picture>
            {% else %}
            <div class="person__photo" aria-hidden="true">{{ person.name | initial }}</div>
            {% endif %}
            <p class="person__name">{{ person.name }}</p>
            {% if person.role %}
            <p class="person__role">{{ person.role }}</p>
            {% else %}
            <p class="person__role person__role--missing">Role still needed</p>
            {% endif %}
            {% if person.bio %}<p class="person__bio">{{ person.bio }}</p>{% endif %}
          </div>
          {% endif %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endmacro %}

    {{ group_block("Administration", "") }}

    <div class="faculty-pair">
      {{ group_block("Support Staff", "faculty-pair__wide") }}
      {{ group_block("Fine Arts", "faculty-pair__narrow") }}
    </div>

    {# The teaching sections run alphabetically by surname. Administration,
       Support Staff and Fine Arts keep the order they are given. #}
    {{ group_block("Elementary", "", true) }}
    {{ group_block("Junior & Senior High", "", true) }}

    <div class="prose">
      

      <h2>Join our faculty</h2>
      <p>Westside Baptist Academy hires teachers who are believers first and teachers second, though we want both. If you are interested in teaching here, write to <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> or call the office at <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phoneHref }}">{{ site.contact.phone }}</a>.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Meet them in person</h2>
    <p>A tour during the school day is the only honest way to see how teachers and students actually talk to each other.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--light" href="/admissions/visit/">Schedule a Tour</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
